aggregate cost valuation matches the public journal API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts Assets:Fund --format json --value --valuation cost

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.00 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 150 SEK
2024-01-01 Buy
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {100 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -1000 SEK

========== STDOUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "1000"
  }
]

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['Assets:Fund'], inValuationCommodity: true, valuation: 'cost' })
